{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Roguelike... but this time, with a squad of heroes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In 7 Squad, you\u2019re not the lone hero anymore. You begin with one cheerful champion and gradually assemble a squad of up to seven charming, weird, and wildly different heroes\u2014each with unique powers and personality.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the chaos unfolds, every new teammate unlocks exciting synergies and transforms your strategy. Dodge swarms of enemies, combine abilities on the fly, and adapt your team to survive the madness. With every run, your squad becomes stronger, sillier, and more satisfying to control.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you\u2019re into fast-paced bullet-hell, roguelike replayability, and managing a lovable crew of tiny heroes\u20147 Squad is calling your name.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4000440?t=1757339481","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4000440?t=1757339481","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4000440/813ff076d89728f22f70334f89c508ae92fed75f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757339481","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4000440/813ff076d89728f22f70334f89c508ae92fed75f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757339481","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Roguelike... but this time, with a squad of heroes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In 7 Squad, you\u2019re not the lone hero anymore. You begin with one cheerful champion and gradually assemble a squad of up to seven charming, weird, and wildly different heroes\u2014each with unique powers and personality.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the chaos unfolds, every new teammate unlocks exciting synergies and transforms your strategy. Dodge swarms of enemies, combine abilities on the fly, and adapt your team to survive the madness. With every run, your squad becomes stronger, sillier, and more satisfying to control.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you\u2019re into fast-paced bullet-hell, roguelike replayability, and managing a lovable crew of tiny heroes\u20147 Squad is calling your name.</p>","developers":["Baxter Games Studio"],"fullgame":{"appid":"3828910","name":"Seven Squad"},"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4000440/2930f0100631e07396e80bb1bbd69b46253800b4/header.jpg?t=1757339481","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257194148,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257194148/movie480.mp4?t=1757339480","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257194148/movie_max.mp4?t=1757339480"},"name":"Seven Squad Demo Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257194148/68df66380d0a7e51590b1e0118e49c12ac0e69d8/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1757339480","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257194148/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1757339480","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257194148/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1757339480"}}],"name":"Seven Squad Demo","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li